# EXPRESS-004 manual requests.
# 1. Start the server: npm run dev:express:4  (starts with tasks t1, t2, t3)
# 2. Click "Send Request" above a request (VS Code extension "REST Client").
# Saving task4.ts restarts the server and brings deleted tasks back.

@host = http://localhost:3000

### Delete t1 (expect 204, empty body)
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/t1

### Delete t1 again (expect 404, it is gone)
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/t1

### Unknown id (expect 404)
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/xyz
